+
+The proof uses weighted quadratic forms only on actual polar eigenvectors; it does not assert an invalid global absolute-value operator inequality. The combinatorial cutoff N32 includes33 summands. Full generic domain, quantitative and time proofs are in the note, with original sources and independent histories preserved.
